<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">        &#39;Add code to clear the memory.&#39;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> &#39;添加清理内存的代码。&#39;</span></span>
